            "title": "Freddie Mac: Multifamily Delinquency Rate Rises To Multi-Decade High",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Federal Trade Commission and Housing Finance Agency seals in downtown with closeup of sign and logo\" data-id=\"1283534665\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1025\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1283534665/image_1283534665.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"></p> <p class=\"item-credits\">ablokhin/iStock Editorial via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <p><em>By Ryan McMaken</em></p> <p>Fannie Mae (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FNMA\" title=\"Federal National Mortgage Association\">FNMA</a>) and Freddie Mac (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FMCC\" title=\"Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corporation\">FMCC</a>) (also known as “GSEs”) have released their August reports on their mortgage portfolios and mortgage delinquencies. Both <a href=\"https://www.fanniemae.com/about-us/investor-relations/monthly-summary\" rel=\"noopener\">Fannie</a> and </p></body></html>",
